  {
   "id": "cell-06",
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## §2 — Exploratory data analysis\n",
    "\n",
    "`run_eda` renders the EDA panels through a state-space lens: drift features → the\n",
    "state-transition mean (`beta` slopes), noise wideners → the measurement-noise scale\n",
    "`sigma_obs`. Includes missingness overview, implied-upside ridges by industry,\n",
    "coord cardinality, the winsorised `feat_*` distributional summary, the observation-noise\n",
    "widener marginals, the feature collinearity heatmap, and per-group implied-upside\n",
    "forests (an EDA preview of the §5 group effects).\n",
    "\n",
    "> Skip this cell for a faster run — nothing downstream depends on it."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "cell-07",
