  {
   "id": "cell-18",
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## §8 — Posterior predictive checks\n",
    "\n",
    "`run_posterior_predictive` samples the fused-panel posterior predictive and draws\n",
    "calibration diagnostics: an ECDF overlay of replicated vs observed standardised\n",
    "responses, a per-`y_series` 94% coverage table, and (best-effort) the ArviZ PIT plot."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "cell-19",
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {
    "ExecuteTime": {
     "end_time": "2026-06-19T21:08:43.748241300Z",
     "start_time": "2026-06-19T21:04:32.231530900Z"
    }
   },
   "source": [
    "run_posterior_predictive(model, idata, panel)"
