  {
   "id": "cell-22",
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## §10 — Expected price targets: posterior screen & export\n",
    "\n",
    "- `summarize_panel_screen` → a `ScreenContext` carrying the posterior `expected_upside`\n",
    "  (`eu`) and `expected_pt` (`ept`) draws over `(chain, draw, isin)`, the per-ISIN\n",
    "  screening `results` table (sorted by expected upside), and the structural-TS\n",
    "  Monte-Carlo `mc_summary` of risk-adjusted forward returns.\n",
    "- `export_analytics` de-standardises the screen and (when `write=True`) appends it to\n",
    "  `analytics.kalman_filtered_price_targets`."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "cell-23",
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {
    "ExecuteTime": {
     "end_time": "2026-06-19T21:10:25.387951300Z",
     "start_time": "2026-06-19T21:10:18.238037500Z"
    }
   },
   "source": [
    "screen = summarize_panel_screen(idata, panel)\n",
    "results = screen.results\n",
    "results.head(15)"
   ],
