  {
   "id": "cell-25",
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## §11 — Single-ISIN time-series Kalman filter (+ §11b stochastic volatility)\n",
    "\n",
    "Switches from the cross-sectional panel to the literal `KalmanFilterPriceTarget` GRW\n",
    "filter on one ISIN's embedded `*_ago` price-target history (a real `(isin, asof_date,\n",
    "price_target)` panel). `run_single_isin_filter` fits the funnel-free parameterization,\n",
    "smooths the latent log-price state, and forecasts to future fiscal events; `…_stochastic_vol`\n",
    "re-fits with the opt-in latent log-volatility random walk + robust Student-t observations."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "cell-26",
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {
    "ExecuteTime": {
     "end_time": "2026-06-19T21:10:39.054762800Z",
     "start_time": "2026-06-19T21:10:27.561801800Z"
    }
   },
   "source": [
    "single_ctx = run_single_isin_filter(panel.frame, engine)\n",
    "run_single_isin_stochastic_vol(single_ctx)"
   ],
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Pulled pml.pml_df history frame: (20, 51)  (43 *_ago columns).\n",
      "Fitting single-ISIN Kalman filter for GB00BVGBY890 (ZEG) on 11 observations spanning 2021-03-31 – 2027-01-01.\n"
     ]
    },
    {
     "name": "stderr",
