  {
   "id": "cell-27",
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## §12 — Mingled-ISIN earnings-window cohort filter (+ §12b stochastic volatility)\n",
    "\n",
    "`run_mingled_cohort_filter` pools the recent-earnings-window cohort into a mingled\n",
    "consensus price-target series and runs the same GRW filter; `…_stochastic_vol` adds the\n",
    "time-varying volatility variant."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "cell-28",
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {
    "ExecuteTime": {
     "end_time": "2026-06-19T21:11:21.548192700Z",
     "start_time": "2026-06-19T21:10:39.165380200Z"
    }
   },
   "source": [
    "mingled_ctx = run_mingled_cohort_filter(panel.frame, engine)\n",
    "run_mingled_cohort_stochastic_vol(panel.frame, mingled_ctx)"
   ],
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
