  {
   "id": "cell-29",
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## §13 — Granular earnings-cohort posterior-predictive forest (+ §13.1 further views)\n",
    "\n",
    "`run_granular_forest` builds the granular earnings-cohort posterior-predictive forest\n",
    "from the fused-panel posterior and screen; `run_granular_further_views` adds the\n",
    "supplementary prior/posterior comparison views."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "cell-30",
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {
    "ExecuteTime": {
     "end_time": "2026-06-19T21:11:23.944442100Z",
     "start_time": "2026-06-19T21:11:21.625393700Z"
    }
   },
   "source": [
    "forest_ctx = run_granular_forest(idata, results, panel, screen, engine)\n",
    "run_granular_further_views(prior_idata, panel, screen, forest_ctx)"
   ],
   "outputs": [
