   "source": [
    "## §14 — Comprehensive summary & actionable recommendations\n",
    "\n",
    "`run_summary` consolidates the cross-sectional screen, the mingled-cohort filter, and the\n",
    "granular forest; `run_recommendations` turns the posterior into decision-oriented\n",
    "screening calls."
   ]
  },
